# Manual Downloads Mapping Example
# If you manually download a restricted file from Telegram, place it in this folder.
# You can either name the file with the message ID (e.g., 253_notes.pdf or msg_253.mp4)
# OR map it here by message ID:
#
# <message_id>: <filename>
#
# Examples:
# 253: lecture_01.pdf
# 254: problem_set_01.pdf

